<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE CLINCH ONE-DAY SERIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE CLINCH ONE-DAY SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat England on faster scoring rate in the second one-day international at Harare Sports Club on Wednesday to clinch the best-of-three series 2-0.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 200 all out (48.5 overs), England 179-7 (target reduced to 185 in 42 overs)</p>
